- ### ASN.1 and DER
+ ### ASN.1 y DER

- The structures beneath certificates, keys and signatures are
- [ASN.1](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASN.1) values, carried in
- [DER](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X.690#DER_encoding). An `Asn1` value models that structure
- directly, as an enumeration of the universal types which certificates use, and `Der` is the
- encoded form:
+ Las estructuras que hay bajo los certificados, las claves y las firmas son valores
+ [ASN.1](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASN.1), transportados en
+ [DER](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X.690#DER_encoding). Un valor `Asn1` modela esa estructura
+ directamente, como una enumeración de los tipos universales que usan los certificados, y `Der`
+ es la forma codificada:

= encoded form:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- val value = Asn1.Sequence(List(Asn1.Integer(BigInt(1)), Asn1.Utf8String(t"hello")))
+ val value = Asn1.Sequence(List(Asn1.Integer(BigInt(1)), Asn1.Utf8String(t"hello")))

- val bytes = value.in[Der]
+ val bytes = value.in[Der]

= val bytes = value.in[Der]
- ```
+ ```

= val bytes = value.in[Der]
= ```
